title: 'Gnomon hardening lane: SIGUSR1 + T-028 M2-M5, L2'
summary: Kernel requires --disable-sigusr1 (shebang env -S; gnomond refuses without it); unlock absolute TTL 60 min + 64-signature cap in broker and helper 1.3.0; unlock.drop on every path with escalation; Cf/bidi stripped + summary quoted in presence prompts; session SBPL denies exec/read of GnomonHelper.app and gnomon-helper; one outstanding fresh prompt per connection + 3 s cooldown after a decline. XPC peer check, C3 probe arms, T-032, T-025 deferred to their own lane.
