  - milestone
body: 'Measured: node --disable-sigusr1 ignores SIGUSR1 (no inspector, process lives); without it SIGUSR1 opens 9229. Helper deny probe: regex exec deny catches pinned/copied/renamed-bundle; read deny stops cp. Full suite: gnomon 1245 passed / 5 skipped / 63 todo; contracts 324; mod-sdk 3; local 89; gui 28+11 todo.'
